--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 ## Unreleased
 
 - `Schedule.cancel(appointment_id)` marks an appointment as cancelled. It stays on record and no longer blocks its slot.
+- `Schedule.reschedule(appointment_id, new_start)` moves an appointment to a new start time, with the same checks as `book()`. Cancelled appointments cannot be moved (`CancelledAppointment`).
 
 ## 0.1.0
 
